.floor(0.10 * man)))\n        print(f"{w}: cnt={cnt}, man={man}, tol={tol}, diff={cnt-man}")\n\ntest_hmax()\n\'\n'] min_timeout_sec: 2.0 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
